{"slug":"members-gallery-teodelina-detry","title":"Teodelina Detry","nav":"Teodelina Detry","desc":"Teodelina Detry Image © Teodelina Detry","img":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1617650409456-U7CS78PF8IZ8CJEPL76T/IMG_1773.jpg","updated":1631759467377,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<h3>PENUMBRA Members Gallery | <strong>Teodelina Detry</strong></h3>"},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"quote","text":" Dancing through the sky and under the sea The ground swell equals visual poetry These wonderful pictures allude to each other And onward towards a certain infinity ","cite":"— Larry Fink"},{"t":"gallery","imgs":[{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1617149947030-474R5KBQQ9NS65AL3GM1/_U9A2275.jpg","alt":"Teodelina Detry — image 1","cap":"","w":454,"h":680},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1617149948094-AC9PLE1QNJUOQ6AOW1FX/_U9A8919.jpg","alt":"Teodelina Detry — image 2","cap":"","w":454,"h":680},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1617149947305-71L78BZAB3S5T129V81O/_U9A5721.jpg","alt":"Teodelina Detry — image 3","cap":"","w":454,"h":681},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1617149947613-SJCUBUFFI124XRN97HPW/_U9A6261.jpg","alt":"Teodelina Detry — image 4","cap":"","w":454,"h":680},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1617149947880-QJRZ97QDI0TJGWPT7L5A/_U9A7402.jpg","alt":"Teodelina Detry — image 5","cap":"","w":454,"h":681},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1617149946818-YDAVAA249A5GFSFXXN0E/_U9A1914.jpg","alt":"Teodelina Detry — image 6","cap":"","w":454,"h":680},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1617150085123-5K7E9CPMJICZR5U72J3W/IMG_1773.jpg","alt":"Teodelina Detry — image 7","cap":"","w":681,"h":454},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1617149946345-Y58KEO0NVVUO65LTT547/_8531.jpg","alt":"Teodelina Detry — image 8","cap":"","w":454,"h":680},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1617149949257-EYPL53AF78Z6YHK8VZUN/_U9A9758.jpg","alt":"Teodelina Detry — image 9","cap":"","w":454,"h":680},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1617149948993-LI0WQ3IPLYI9VCWHZ54K/_U9A9728.jpg","alt":"Teodelina Detry — image 10","cap":"","w":454,"h":680},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1617149948473-24H54338UOITLRNATPHW/_U9A8941.jpg","alt":"Teodelina Detry — image 11","cap":"","w":454,"h":680},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1617149948625-M5TFHJYAOCU33WVY6VZ4/_U9A9235.jpg","alt":"Teodelina Detry — image 12","cap":"","w":454,"h":680},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1617149946456-SO7KD67GM5Y4APZYZ1IQ/_U9A1620.jpg","alt":"Teodelina Detry — image 13","cap":"","w":454,"h":681}]},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"text","html":"<p>These photographs belong to my first photobook, “La Anemona es una flor que se abre al menor golpe de viento”, (The Anemone is a flower that opens herself to the slightest touch of wind\"). They show my way of seeing life and its fragility. All of these images capture moments of freedom where silences are filled with gestures. And in those gestures I find poetry. I seek to reveal the hidden and melancholic relationship that exists between things. In other words, inhabit with light those uninhabited spaces and evidence their sensitivity. </p>"},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"text","html":"<p><strong>Teodelina Detry</strong> was born in Argentina in 1975. She studied Art Direction and later took several art-related courses at Parsons School in NYC. Back in BA she studied at Andy Goldstein's School of Photography, with Inés Miguens, Santiago Carrera, Juan Astica, and at Proyecto Imaginario while living in Switzerland with Aline Kundig and Athena Carey. In USA and France she did workshops with Alain Laboile.  In 2017/18/19 she exhibited her work at the Tattersal in BA. In 2019, with Zona de Photo at BA Photo Fair and at Mundo Nuevo Art Gallery. In 2020 she published her first photography book.</p><p><a href=\"https://teodelinadetry.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">www.teodelinadetry.com</a></p>"},{"t":"hr"},{"t":"text","html":"<p>← <a href=\"/members-gallery-cindy-weisbart\">previous</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/members-gallery-osheen-harruthoonyan\">next</a> →</p>"}]}